Bxe5 Qxe5 28. b3 Kg7 29. Ne2 Nc5 30. f4 Qa1+ 31. Kh2 Ne4 32. Qd5 Nf2 33. d7
Qh1+ 34. Kg3 Qe1 35. Qd4+ {Source: Westminster Bulletin. Contributed by Gerald
Hartmann, 13 September 2023.} 1-0

